==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|слепи́ть}}

===Etymology 1===
{{af|ru|с-|лепи́ть}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|слепи́ть|pf|impf=лепи́ть,слепля́ть}}

# to [[model]], to [[sculpture]], to [[sculpt]], to [[fashion]], to [[shape]]
# to [[build]], to [[make]] (cells, nest, etc.)
# to [[stick]] [[together]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c+p|слепи́ть}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|слепля́ться|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|слепи́ться|g=pf}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ru|лепно́й}}
* {{l|ru|ле́пка}}

