{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*slěpiti}}. {{surf|ru|слепо́й|-и́ть}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|слепи́ть|impf}}

# {{topics|ru|Vision}} to [[blind]], to [[dazzle]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[снег]] '''слепи́т''' [[глаз|глаза́]]|the snow is dazzling/blinding}}

